2 CONC a Rodriguez, Diego (Rodriguez De Treviño Sosa) Rodríguez De Treviño Sosa (Rodriguez De Treviño Sosa), Melchora Sanchez (born Navarro Rodriguez), <Private> Rodríguez, Beatriz Sosa Albornoz (born Navarro Rodriguez CastaÑo), <Private
2 CONC > Sanchez Suarez De Longoria (born Navarro Rodriguez), <Private> Martinez Guaxardo (born Navarro Rodriguez), <Private> Taranjo (born Rodríguez Montemayor De Sosa), <Private> Navarro Wife:	Juliana Garcia Rodriguez (born Quintanilla
2 CONC  Farias) Children:	Diego Garcia Farias, <Private> Garcia Farias, Tomas Garcia De Quintanilla
