2 CONT
2 CONT Diego GARCIA de Quintanilla [1788],[1801] 
2 CONT *was born about 1601. 
2 CONT *He died by 1695 at the age of 94 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, New Spain. 
2 CONT *He was buried in Hacienda Santa Catalina. 
2 CONT *Parents: Capt. Lucas GARCIA and Juliana de QUINTANILLA.
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Mariana de ZALDIVAR (aka Mariana or Maria Ana de Sosa). Mariana de ZALDIVAR (aka Mariana or Maria Ana de Sosa) and Diego GARCIA de Quintanilla were married. Children were: 
2 CONT *1. Augustina GARCIA, 
2 CONT *2. Gaspar GARCIA, 
2 CONT *3. Josefa GARCIA de Quintanilla (aka Josefa de Sosa), 
2 CONT *4. Vicente de ZALDIVAR, 
2 CONT *5. Maria de SOSA, 
2 CONT *6. Thomas GARCIA de Quintanilla, 
2 CONT *7. Gertrudis GARCIA (aka Gertrudis Zaldivar), 
2 CONT *8. Diego GARCIA.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.raullongoria.net/Genealogy/FamilyTree/b83.html#P945
2 CONT
2 CONT =================================================
2 CONT
2 CONT 52. Lucas García Rodríguez, 
2 CONT *born Abt. 1575. 
2 CONT *He married 53. Juliana Quintanilla Farías. 
2 CONT *(Parents of Diego)
2 CONT
2 CONT 53. Juliana Quintanilla Farías, 
2 CONT *born Abt. 1578. 
2 CONT *She was the daughter of 106. Capitán Juan de Farías and 107. María de Treviño Quintanilla. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Lucas Rodríguez and Juliana Farías are: 
2 CONT
2 CONT *1.  26 i.   Diego García Quintanilla, born Abt. 1601; died 1695; married María Saldivar de Sosa. 
2 CONT *2.    ii.   Tomás García de Quintanilla, married Isabel Arredondo Sosa. 
2 CONT *3.    iii.   Mariana García. 
2 CONT
2 CONT http://familytreemaker.genealogy.com/users/m/c/c/Roy-R-Mccandless/GENE3-0006.html
2 CONT
2 CONT ---
2 CONT
2 CONT 26. Diego García Quintanilla, 
2 CONT *born Abt. 1601; 
2 CONT *died 1695. 
2 CONT *He was the son of 52. Lucas García Rodríguez and 53. Juliana Quintanilla Farías. 
2 CONT *He married 27. María Saldivar de Sosa. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 27. María Saldivar de Sosa, 
2 CONT *born Abt. 1615; 
2 CONT *died 1701. 
2 CONT *She was the daughter of 54. Capitán Vicente Saldivar y Reza and 55. María de Sosa Farías. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Diego Quintanilla and María de Sosa is: 
2 CONT
2 CONT *1.  13 i.   Agustina García de Quintantilla, born Abt. 1660 in Monterrey; married Pedro Longoria Rodríguez 8-7-1678 in Monterrey. 
2 CONT
2 CONT http://familytreemaker.genealogy.com/users/m/c/c/Roy-R-Mccandless/GENE3-0005.html
2 CONT
2 CONT ==============================================================
2 CONT
2 CONT From Descendants of Ferdinand V by the Pulido123.com website:
2 CONT
2 CONT http://pulido123.com/index_htm_files/Ferdinand%20V%20for%2015%20Generations.pdf
2 CONT
2 CONT Gen 8 Pat: Lucas Garcia = Juliana de Quintanilla
2 CONT
2 CONT Gen 8 Mat: Maria de Sosa = Vicente de Reza (b. 1618, m. 1615, par. Juan de Farias and Maria Quintanilla)
2 CONT
2 CONT Gen 9: Diego G. de Quinanilla (c1601 - 1669) = Mariana d. de Sosa (c1615 - 10/27/1701, m. c1629)
2 CONT
2 CONT Gen 10:
2 CONT *1. Gertrudis G. de Quintanilla = ?
2 CONT **Children (Gen 11): Juana, Lucia, Diego
2 CONT *2. Clara G. de Quintanilla
2 CONT *3. Diego G. de Quintanilla (d. 1693) = Beatriz de Roelas (m. 9/20/1676)
2 CONT *4. Margarita G. de Quintanilla (d. 1695)
2 CONT *5. Tomas G. de Quintanilla (d. 3/29/1697) = Maria de Saldivar (prob. transposed, other sources indicate Petronila Rodriguez Fernandez de Montemayor, dau. Mateo Rodriguez de Montemayor and Leonor Fernandez de Tijerina)
2 CONT *6. Vicente (G. de Quintanilla) = Maria de Trevino (m. 6/15/1687, par. Melchor de Trevino and Laureana Diaz)
2 CONT *7. Antonia G. de Quintanilla = Matea C. de Leon (par. Alonso de Leon and Augustina Cantu)
2 CONT **Child (Gen 11): Matiana de Leon = Carlos G. Hidalgo (par. Mateo Hidalgo and Maria Davila) 
2 CONT ***with grandchildren (Gen 12) Pedro and Carlos
2 CONT *8. Lucia G. de Quintanilla (b. c1630) = Miguel R. de Montemayor (d. 7/16/1720, par. Diego de Montemayor and Inez Falcon) (Chronological problem with child born in 1717... user asserted was the daughter of Diego and Beatriz m. 167
2 CONC 6.)
2 CONT *9. Nicolas G. de Quintanilla (c1633 - 10/29/1690)
2 CONT *10. Maria de Garcia (c1652 - 1/3/1700) = Baltasar de Trevino (c1636 - 10/5/1696, m. 7/4/1672, par. Marcos de la Garza Falcon Trevino and Anastasia Hidalgo)
2 CONT **Children (Gen 11): Alonso de Trevino (birth date off) = Catalina de Ayala (par. Jose de Ayala and Ana Baez Benavides)
2 CONT *11. Agustina G. (de Quintanilla) (b. c1660) = Pedro P. Longoria (b. 1655, m. 8/7/1678, par. Lorenzo de Longoria and Antonia Perez)
2 CONT **Children (Gen 11) Mariana, Jose, Maria, Juan (b. 1698) = Clara B. Chapa (m. 1718, par Nicolas Chapa and Inez Benavides)
2 CONT ***with grandchildren (Gen 12): Antonio, Antonia, Jose, Tomas, Ana, Juana, Vicente, Anastacia, Juana, Pedro, Petra, Agueda
2 CONT *12. Gaspar G. de Quintanilla (c1660-6/10/1685) = Juana M. de Morales (d. 8/8/1689, m. 9/29/1681, par. Antonio Villarreal and Maria de Montemayor)
2 CONT *13 Josefa G. de Quintinalla (1662 - 9/12/1685) = Juan de Trevino (par. Melchor de Trevino and Laureana Diaz)
2 CONT **Children (Gen 11) Juan (b. 3/29/1682) and Cristobal (b. 3/29/1682) = Gertrudis Nagas and Maria de la Garza
