1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Maria de SOSA400,2981 was born (date unknown). Parents: 2nd Lt. Alonso de FARIAS and Ana de SOSA ALBORNOZ.
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Capt. Vicente de ZALDIVAR y Ressa. Children were: Maria de Zaldivar SOSA, Vicente de ZALDIVAR, Ana de ZALDIVAR, Mariana de ZALDIVAR (aka Mariana or Maria Ana de Sosa), Margarita de ZALDIVAR (aka Margarita de Sosa), Agustin
2 CONC  de ZALDIVAR.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.raullongoria.net/Genealogy/FamilyTree/b214.html#P986
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT (d)	Maria SOSA FARIAS 
2 CONT *m. Vicente SALDIVAR REZA, 
2 CONT **b. 1597, (son of Juan GUERRA REZA and Ana (Magdalena?) SALDIVAR MENDOZA). 
2 CONT *daughter of  Ana SOSA NAVARRO m. 1611, Alonso FARIAS TREVIÑO
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT * [1]	Vicente SOSA SALDIVAR 
2 CONT **m. Ursula URRUTIA IZAGUIRRE.
2 CONT * [2]	Agustin SALDIVAR SOSA 
2 CONT **b. 1620, 
2 CONT **m. Ana DE-SALINAS.  
2 CONT **Agustin died 7 Feb 1677, Monterrey, N.L., Mex.
2 CONT * [3]	Juan SOSA SALDIVAR 
2 CONT **m. Ana MARTINEZ HERNANDEZ, (daughter of Jose MARTINEZ and Maria HERNANDEZ DIAZ).
2 CONT * [4]	Ana SOSA SALDIVAR 
2 CONT **m. Ambrocio CEPEDA DE-LA-FUENTE.
2 CONT * [5]	Mariana SOSA SALDIVAR 
2 CONT **m. Diego GARCIA DE-QUINTANILLA, (son of Lucas GARCIA RODRIGUEZ and Juliana QUINTANILLA FARIAS).
2 CONT * [6]	Margarita SOSA SALDIVAR 
2 CONT **b. 1635, 
2 CONT **m. bet 1653 and 16, Diego AYALA TREVIÑO, 
2 CONT ***b. 1618 or 1619, (son of Jose TREVIÑO QUINTANILLA and Leonor DE-AYALA VALVERDE) 
2 CONT ***d. 25 Dec 1682, Monterrey, N.L., Mex.
2 CONT * [7]	Maria SOSA SALDIVAR 
2 CONT **m. Pedro GARCIA GUERRA.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://vsalgs.org/stnemgenealogy/alonsoes.html
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT She is the Great-great-great-great grand-daughter to the Royal Treasurer of New Spain, Don Alonso de Estrada. Source: From the book, Mil Familias III, by Rodolfo Gonzalez de la Garza. He list her parents as Alonso de Farias Treviñ
2 CONC o and Ana de Sosa Navarro.
2 CONT
2 CONT Her grandfather, Captain Alonso de Sosa Albernoz was murdered in New Mexico by Juan de Oñate's men. Her mother was killed by Indians near Santa Fe, New Mexico, (Research):http://www.somosprimos.com/inclan/pedrogonzal.htm&nbsp; n.6
2 CONC 63
