1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 1. Don BLAS MARIA2 DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON-TREVINO was born Abt. 1591 in Real de Mapimi, Durango, Mexico, and died February 21, 1669 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. He married BEATRIZ GONZALEZ-HIDALGO-NAVARRO Bef. 162
2 CONC 6 in Saltillo, Coahulia, Mexico, daughter of MARCOS GONZALEZ-HIDALGO-DE-VALLE and MARIANA NAVARRO-RODRIGUEZ. She was born Abt. 1591 in Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico, and died May 10, 1670 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
