1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://gw5.geneanet.org/sanchiz?lang=en;pz=tomas;nz=sanchez+garza;ocz=0;p=maria+ines;n=rodriguez+montemayor
2 CONT
2 CONT children:
2 CONT *1. Diego Rodríguez 
2 CONT *2. María Rodríguez Rodríguez 
2 CONT *3. Lucas García Rodríguez 
2 CONT
2 CONT ================================
2 CONT
2 CONT Ines RODRIGUEZ [765] was born about 1550. I show Ines Rodriguez as the daughter of Diego de Montemayor and Inez Rodriguez because several published sources make that assertion; however, there are some who question, due to a lack o
2 CONC f available evidence, whether she was indeed a daughter of Diego de Montemayor. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents: Governor Diego de MONTEMAYOR and Ines RODRIGUEZ.
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Baltasar de SOSA. Ines RODRIGUEZ and Baltasar de SOSA [365],[1867] were married. 
2 CONT
2 CONT A census of the Villa of Cerralvo (Monterrey) conducted on September 4, 1626, noted that Lucas Garcia and his family did not have a house at that time and that they lived in the house of his brother Diego Rodriguez. Diego Rodrigue
2 CONC z' dwelling is described as being 50 paces from and facing the Convent of San Francisco. The dwelling contained 2 rooms and "un torrecilla alta", or small tower. Diego Rodriguez and his family lived in one of the rooms, his brothe
2 CONC r Lucas Garcia lived in the other room, and Diego Rodriguez' son-in-law Miguel de Montemayor lived with his family in the small tower. Children were: Capt. Diego RODRIGUEZ, Maria RODRIGUEZ, Capt. Lucas GARCIA.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.raullongoria.net/Genealogy/FamilyTree/b190.html#P955
2 CONT
2 CONT ==============
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.vsalgs.org/stnemgenealogy/BernardoGutierrez.pdf
2 CONT
2 CONT Beatriz NAVARRO RODRIGUEZ b. abt. 1570 d. bef. 1626 married Bernabe DE-LAS-CASAS LOPEZ b. abt. 1573 m. abt. 1602 d. 1632   daugher of  Maria RODRIGUEZ SOSA married  Juan NAVARRO SOSA b. 1533 m. abt. 1559 d. 1594 daughter of Baltaz
2 CONC ar DE-SOSA  married  Maria Ines RODRIGUEZ MONTEMAYOR  b. abt. 1549 daughter of Gobernador Diego DE-MONTEMAYOR HERNANDEZ b. abt. 1530 m. abt. 1548 d. abt. 1610 married  Ines RODRIGUEZ b. abt. 1531 son of Juan DE-MONTEMAYOR married 
2 CONC  Mayor HERNANDEZ
2 CONT
2 CONT ---
2 CONT
2 CONT From the work of Miguel A. Ayala (webcached 12/29/2012):
2 CONT
2 CONT http://webcache.googleusercontent.com/search?q=cache:http://familytreemaker.genealogy.com/users/a/y/a/Miguel-A-Ayala-TX/WEBSITE-0001/UHP-0356.html
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for Inés Rodriguez de Montemayor:
2 CONT
2 CONT Beth Perez internet site lists Ines as Ines Rodriguez Carbajal. After contacting Beth for more information on where she had obtained the Carbajal last name, she was unable to provide a source. More research is required as to the v
2 CONC alidity of the Carbajal last name.
2 CONT
2 CONT Inés Rodríguez, wife of Baltasar de Sosa. In 1548 Diego de Montemayor and Inés Rodríguez, his wife, embarked in Seville in route to la Nueva España.428 We have the suspicion that Diego de Montemayor was married three times: first 
2 CONC with Inés Rodríguez, secondly with María de Esquivel, and thirdly with Juana Porcallo de la Cerca. Might the Inés Rodríguez married to Baltasar de Sosa not have been the daughter of his first marriage? If it were so, and Lucas Gar
2 CONC cía would be grandsons of the governor Diego de Montemayor.
2 CONT
2 CONT Information taken from: History of the New Kingdom of Leon, http://www.library.ci.corpus-christi.tx.us/newkingdom/reinogeneralindex.htm
