2 CONT Cavazos Garza, Israel.  ''Catálogo y Síntesis de los Protocolos del Archivo Municipal de Monterrey 1599-1700'', Instituto Tecnologico y de Estudios Superiores de Monterrey, Monterrey, Nuevo León, México, 1966, page 276, #790 [XVII
2 CONC I, exp. 8, fol. 2 v].  ...  This protocolo describes the dowry of his marriage contract with Mónica Rodríguez, citing her parents, and is dated twice--Villa de Cerralvo, 20 February 1628, and Monterrey, 19 August 1636.
2 CONT
2 CONT _____________________________________
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. MIGUEL3 DEL CANTO-MONTEMAYOR (ALBERTO2 DEL CANTO, SEBASTIANO MARTINS1) was born 1586 in Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico, and died Aft. 11 Oct 1643 in Hacienda de los Nogales, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. He married (2) MONICA RODR
2 CONC IGUEZ-TREVINO 1624 in Mexico City, F.D. Mexico, daughter of DIEGO RODRIGUEZ-DE-SOSA and SEBASTIANA DE FARIAS-Y-TREVINO-QUINTANILLA. She was born Abt. 1592 in Mexico City, D.F., Mexico, and died 30 Jun 1681 in Hacienda de los Nogal
2 CONC es, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for MIGUEL DEL CANTO-MONTEMAYOR:
2 CONT
2 CONT A.K.A. Miguel de Montemayor.
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth date from the book, ''Historia del Nuevo Reino de Leon'', by Engenio del Hoyo. Page 102
2 CONT
2 CONT His will is dated October 11, 1643, Source: ''With All Arms'' by Carl Laurence Duaine. Page 108.
2 CONT
2 CONT ''Testamentos Coloniales de Monterrey'', by Lilia E. Villanueva de Cavazos. Page18
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of MIGUEL DEL CANTO-MONTEMAYOR are:
2 CONT
2 CONT i. MARIA4 DEL CANTO, m. JUAN MALDONADO.
2 CONT
2 CONT ii. JUANA DEL CANTO, m. ANDRES DE CHARLES.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of MIGUEL DEL CANTO-MONTEMAYOR and MONICA RODRIGUEZ-TREVINO are:
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. iii. DIEGO4 RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR, b. Abt. 1623, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; d. 03 May 1676, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. iv. MARIA-MARGARITA RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR, b. Abt. 1626, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; d. 27 Feb 1680/81, Hacienda San Juan Bautista, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT 5. v. PETRONILA RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR, b. Abt. 1627, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; d. 28 Aug 1672, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT 6. vi. MARIA RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR, b. 1628, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT 7. vii. COMMANDER JUAN-FRANCISCO RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR, b. 1629.
2 CONT
2 CONT viii. DOMINGO MONTEMAYOR-RODRIGUEZ, b. 1630.
2 CONT
2 CONT ix. JOSE MONTEMAYOR-RODRIGUEZ, b. 1631.
2 CONT
2 CONT x. BERNARDO MONTEMAYOR-RODRIGUEZ, b. Abt. 1632.
2 CONT
2 CONT 8. xi. SECOND LIEUTENANT MATEO RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR, b. 1633.
2 CONT
2 CONT 9. xii. BERNARDA RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR, b. 1640.
2 CONT
2 CONT 10. xiii. INEZ RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR, b. 1645; d. 12 Apr 1712, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
