2 CONT 1584. Capitan Miguel MONTEMAYOR was born in 1588 in Saltillo,Coahuila,Mexico. He died on Oct 25 1643 in Hacienda de los Nogales,Nuevo Leon,Mexico. He married Monica RODRIGUEZ in 1618 in Monterrey,Nuevo Leon,Mexico. [Parents] 
2 CONT
2 CONT 1585. Monica RODRIGUEZ was born in 1600 in Monterrey,Nuevo Leon,Mexico. She died in Jun 1681 in Hacienda de los Nogales,Nuevo Leon,Mexico. [Parents] 
2 CONT
2 CONT http://home.earthlink.net/~crisrendon/pafg17.htm#5316
2 CONT
2 CONT said to be son of 
2 CONT
2 CONT 3168. Alberto CANTO was born in 1547 in Isle Terceira,Azores,Portugal. He died on Dec 10 1611 in Saltillo,Coahuila,Mexico. He married Estefana MONTEMAYOR in 1585 in Saltillo,Coahuila,Mexico. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 3169. Estefana MONTEMAYOR was born in 1551 in Mazapil,Zacatecas,Mexico. 
2 CONT
