1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Augustina GARCIA1788 was born about 1660 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, New Spain.572 Parents: Diego GARCIA de Quintanilla and Mariana de ZALDIVAR (aka Mariana or Maria Ana de Sosa).
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Pedro LONGORIA Rodriguez. Augustina GARCIA and Pedro LONGORIA Rodriguez were married on 7 August 1678 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, New Spain.420,1788 Agustina Garcia was a second cousin to Antonia Rodriguez, Pedro's mother. C
2 CONC hildren were: Juan Diego LONGORIA Garcia, Juana LONGORIA Garcia, Joseph LONGORIA Garcia, Francisca Maria Suarez de LONGORIA Garcia.
2 CONT
