2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT 54. Capitán Vicente Saldivar y Reza, born 1597. He was the son of 108. Juan Guerra de Reza and 109. Ana de Zaldivar y Oñate. He married 55. María de Sosa Farías 1614 in Zacatecas. 
2 CONT        55. María de Sosa Farías, born Abt. 1600. She was the daughter of 110. General Alonso Farías Treviño and 111. Ana Sosa Navarro. 
2 CONT
2 CONT More About Capitán Vicente Saldivar y Reza:
2 CONT *Fact 1: 1590, With Oñate expedition to NM
2 CONT *Fact 2: His men ambushed and killed Alonso de Sosa Albornoz
2 CONT *Fact 3: Returned to Zacatecas
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Capitán Reza and María Farías are: 
2 CONT *i.   Vicente Sosa Saldivar, married Ursula Urrutia Izaguirre. 
2 CONT *ii.   Agustín Saldivar Sosa, born 1620; died 2-7-1676/77 in Monterrey; married Ana de Salinas. 
2 CONT *iii.   Juan Sosa Saldivar, married Ana Martínez Hernandez. 
2 CONT *iv.   Ana Sosa Saldivar, married Ambrocio Cepeda de la Fuente. 
2 CONT *27 v.   María Saldivar de Sosa, born Abt. 1615; died 1701; married Diego García Quintanilla. 
2 CONT *vi.   Margarita Sosa Saldivar, born 1635; married Diego Ayala Treviño. 
2 CONT *vii.   María Sosa Saldivar, married Pedro García Guerra. 
2 CONT
2 CONT http://familytreemaker.genealogy.com/users/m/c/c/Roy-R-Mccandless/GENE3-0006.html
2 CONT
2 CONT 26. Diego García Quintanilla, born Abt. 1601; died 1695. He was the son of 52. Lucas García Rodríguez and 53. Juliana Quintanilla Farías. He married 27. María Saldivar de Sosa. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 27. María Saldivar de Sosa, born Abt. 1615; died 1701. She was the daughter of 54. Capitán Vicente Saldivar y Reza and 55. María de Sosa Farías. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Diego Quintanilla and María de Sosa is: 
2 CONT *13 i.   Agustina García de Quintantilla, born Abt. 1660 in Monterrey; married Pedro Longoria Rodríguez 8-7-1678 in Monterrey. 
2 CONT
