1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Lorenzo Suarez de LONGORIA Salazar688,1690,1788 was born about 1629 in Monterrey ?, , New Spain. He died before 1678 at the age of 49. Lorenzo Suarez de Longoria (the Second) was the natural son of Lorenzo Suarez d
2 CONC e Longoria (the First) and Ana de Salazar. He lived in either Saltillo or Monterrey, or perhaps in both cities at different times. Lorenzo (the Second) had several children by Antonia Rodriguez (citizen of Monterrey) and at least 
2 CONC one child (Nicolas Suarez de Longoria) by Beatriz Gonzalez. His father mentioned only two grandchildren (Maria de Longoria and Jose de Longoria) in his will; there is no mention of Pedro Rodriguez Longoria, Francisco Rodriguez Lon
2 CONC goria, or Nicolas Suarez de Longoria.
2 CONT
