1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Diego MONTEMAYOR RODRIGUEZ m. 1664/65, Maria Ines DE-LA-GARZA GONZALEZ HIDALGO, b. abt 1642, (daughter of Blas DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON TREVIÑO and Beatriz GONZALEZ-HIDALGO NAVARRO) d. 12 Mar 1690.  Diego died 3 May 1676
2 CONC .
2 CONT * 			a.	Maria RODRIGUEZ MONTEMAYOR m. 21 Jun 1689, in Monterrey, N.L., Mex, Antonio LOPEZ PRIETO, (son of Nicolas LOPEZ PRIETO and Maria AYALA OVALLE). 
2 CONT * 			b.	Juan RODRIGUEZ MONTEMAYOR DE-LA-GARZA m. 21 Oct 1691, in Monterrey, N.L., Mex, Antonia GALVAN BOTELLO, (daughter of Diego GALVAN and Petronila BOTELLO DE-LA-GARZA). 
2 CONT * 			c.	Francisco RODRIGUEZ MONTEMAYOR DE-LA-GA m. 23 Nov 1684, in Monterrey, N.L., Mex, Maria CABALLERO BARRAZA. 
2 CONT  		  http://www.vsalgs.org/stnemgenealogy/diegom.html
2 CONT =========================
2 CONT MARIA-INES3 DE-LA-GARZA-GONZALEZ-HIDALGO (BLAS MARIA2 DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON-TREVINO, MARCOS-ALONSO1 DE-LA-GARZA-Y-ARCON) was born Abt. 1623 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, and died March 12, 1690 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. S
2 CONC he married DIEGO RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR 1664 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, son of MIGUEL DEL CANTO-MONTEMAYOR and MONICA RODRIGUEZ-TREVINO. He was born Abt. 1623 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, and died May 03, 1676 in Mont
2 CONC errey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for DIEGO RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR:
2 CONT
2 CONT Mil Familias III by Rodolfo Gonzalez de la Garza. Page 67.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of MARIA-INES DE-LA-GARZA-GONZALEZ-HIDALGO and DIEGO RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR are:
2 CONT
2 CONT 46. i. JOSEPH4 RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR.
2 CONT
2 CONT ii. GERTRUDIS RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR, b. Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; m. (1) JUAN DE-LAS-CASAS-DE-LA-VEGA, September 27, 1679, Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; b. Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; d. June 03,
2 CONC  1694, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; m. (2) JOSEPH DE TREVINO, April 21, 1700, Sagrario Metro, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; b. Valle de Carrizal, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for JUAN DE-LAS-CASAS-DE-LA-VEGA: Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara, by Raul J. Guerra., Nadine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela, Jr. Page 37.
2 CONT
2 CONT 47. iii. FRANCISCO RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR, b. 1650.
2 CONT
2 CONT 48. iv. MARGARITA RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR, b. 1652.
2 CONT
2 CONT 49. v. CAPTAIN JUAN RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR-DE-LA-GARZA, b. November 29, 1668, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT 50. vi. MIGUEL RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR, b. 1669, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT 51. vii. INEZ RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR-DE-LA-GARZA, b. September 23, 1669, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT viii. CAPTAIN DIEGO RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR, b. 1670; m. MARIANA RUIZ-DE-OCON-SALAZAR, June 21, 1689, Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; b. 1672.
2 CONT
2 CONT 52. ix. CAPTAIN NICOLAS RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR, b. 1671.
2 CONT
2 CONT 53. x. ANNA-MARIA RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR, b. 1671.
2 CONT
2 CONT xi. SANTIAGO MONTEMAYOR-DE-LA-GARZA, b. November 05, 1676, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT 54. xii. DOROTHEA RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR, b. 1682.
2 CONT
