2 CONT Ines DE LA GARZA1150,1240 was born (date unknown). Parents: Capt. Blas DE LA GARZA FALCON and Beatriz GONZALEZ Hidalgo.
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Capt. Diego RODRIGUEZ de Montemayor. Ines DE LA GARZA and Capt. Diego RODRIGUEZ de Montemayor were married. Children were: Margarita RODRIGUEZ, Capt. Joseph RODRIGUEZ de Montemayor, Gertrudis RODRIGUEZ de Montemayor, Juan 
2 CONC RODRIGUEZ, Capt. Nicolas RODRIGUEZ de Montemayor, Diego RODRIGUEZ de Montemayor, Capt. Francisco RODRIGUEZ de Montemayor, Inez RODRIGUEZ, Miguel RODRIGUEZ de Montemayor, Dorotea RODRIGUEZ de Montemayor.
