2 CONC  Federal, Mexico, reference 2:2BKXQ3R; FHL microfilm 35,267.  ...  Name: '''Blas De La Garza'''; Spouse's Name: Theresa Guerrero; Event Date: '''03 Feb 1643'''; Event Place: '''Asuncion, Mexico, Distrito Federal, Mexico'''
