2 CONT 7. SERGEANT MAJOR BLAS3 DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON (BLAS MARIA2 DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON-TREVINO, MARCOS-ALONSO1 DE-LA-GARZA-Y-ARCON) 
2 CONT *was born 1621 in Saltillo, Coahulia, Mexico, and 
2 CONT *died October 03, 1689 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. 
2 CONT *He married TERESA GUERRERO February 03, 1643 in Asuncion Catolica, Cuauhtemoc, Distrito Federal, Mexico. 
2 CONT **She was born in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, and 
2 CONT **died August 16, 1677 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT ***Notes for SERGEANT MAJOR BLAS DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON: Between 1667 and 1676, he served as Governor of Nuevo Leon. Origin of the surnames Garza and Trevino in Nuevo Leon by Tomas Mendirichaga Cueva. Page 23. Northern New Spain, A Re
2 CONC search Guide, by Thomas C. Barnes, Thomas H. Naylor, and Charles W. Polzer.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of BLAS DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON and TERESA GUERRERO are:
2 CONT *1. i. MARIA4 DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON, 
2 CONT **d. February 09, 1670, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *2. 41. ii. JACINTA DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON.
2 CONT *3. 42. iii. MIGUEL DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON.
2 CONT *4. 43. iv. JOSEPH DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON, 
2 CONT **b. 1650, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; 
2 CONT **d. Abt. 1713, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *5. 44. v. CATALINA DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON, 
2 CONT **b. 1650.
2 CONT *6. 45. vi. CAPTAIN TOMAS DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON, 
2 CONT **b. 1668, Cadereita Jimenez, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
