1 NOTE {geni:about_me} It may be that Maria de Uzcanga is the same person I show as Maria Duran in this database. In marriage investigation #39-18, page 171, a notation indicates that "Maria de Vzcanca is related to Juana de la Garza in 
2 CONC the second degree 'pro copula illicita'", indicating that Maria de Vzcanga and Juana de la Garza were first cousins through an illegitimate relationship. Maria de Duran was married to Francisco Sanchez, son of Juan Sanchez and Mar
2 CONC ia de la Barrera; Maria de Duran was also a second cousin of Juana de la Garza by virtue of her mother Catalina de Trevino being an illegitimate child of Joseph de Trevino, brother of Juana de la Garza's grandmother. The degree of
2 CONC  relationship with Juana de la Garza is not the same for Maria de Uzcanga and Maria Duran but it is similar enough to warrant further research.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Maria DURAN1509 was born (date unknown). It may be that Maria Duran is the same person I show as Maria de Uzcanga in this database. In marriage investigation #39-18, page 171, Maria de Uzcanga is shown as being married to Francisc
2 CONC o Sanchez de Barrera, and a notation indicates that "Maria de Vzcanca is related to Juana de la Garza in the second degree 'pro copula illicita'", indicating that Maria de Vzcanga and Juana de la Garza were first cousins through a
2 CONC n illegitimate relationship. Maria de Duran was married to Francisco Sanchez, son of Juan Sanchez and Maria de la Barrera; Maria de Duran was also a second cousin of Juana de la Garza by virtue of her mother Catalina de Treviño be
2 CONC ing an illegitimate child of Joseph de Treviño, brother of Juana de la Garza's grandmother. The degree of relationship with Juana de la Garza is not the same for Maria de Uzcanga and Maria Duran but it is similar enough to warrant
2 CONC  further research. Parents: Antonio DURAN and Catalina de TREVIÑO.
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Francisco SANCHEZ. Children were: Sergeant Tomas SANCHEZ, Alferez Joseph SANCHEZ.
2 CONT
