2 CONT 1. CAPTAIN ALBERTO2 DEL CANTO (SEBASTIANO MARTINS1) was born 1547 in Isla Terciaria de los Azores, Portugal, and died Dec 1611 in Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico. He married (1) CATALINA DE ALFARO. She died in Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexic
2 CONC o. He married (2) ESTEFANA DE MONTEMAYOR-Y-PORCALLO Abt. 1585 in Mexico City, D.F., Mexico, daughter of DIEGO DE HERNANDEZ-MONTEMAYOR and JUANA PORCALLO-Y-DE-LA-CERDA. She was born 1573 in Mexico City, D.F., Mexico, and died Abt. 
2 CONC 1660.
