1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 56.  Jose Salvador Montemayor de la Garza FALCON (Juan Gonzales de la Garza, Blas Maria  Trevino De La Garza, Marcos Alonzo Garza Y del Arcon) was born 1659. BIOGRAPHY: Jose Salvador de la Garza Falcon was the gran
2 CONC tee of the  Espiritu Santo land grant which was located in present day Cameron County, Texas. He established  his ranch which he called Rancho Viejo in about 1790. Here he raised  his family Jose married Gertrudes Gomez de la Garz
2 CONC a FALCON, daughter of Blas Maria Villarreal de la  Garza FALCON and Catarina Gomez de CASTRO. Gertrudes was born 1734 in Cerralva, Nuevo  Leon, Mexico, New Spain.
2 CONT
