2 CONT 26. CAPTAIN BLAS5 DE-LA-GARZA-MONTEMAYOR (MARIA-MARGARITA4 RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR, MIGUEL3 DEL CANTO-MONTEMAYOR, ALBERTO2 DEL CANTO, SEBASTIANO MARTINS1) 
2 CONT *was born 1670 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, and 
2 CONT *died May 1719 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. 
2 CONT *He married (1) MARGARITA LOPEZ-PRIETO 13 Jan 1682 in Salinas Victoria, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, 
2 CONT **daughter of NICOLAS LOPEZ-PRIETO and MARIA AYALA-OVALLE. She was born 1664. 
2 CONT *He married (2) ANGELA MENDEZ-DE-TOVAR-HIDALGO 15 Aug 1701 in Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, 
2 CONT **daughter of JOSEPH MENDEZ-DE-TOVAR and LEONOR GUTIERREZ-HIDALGO. She was born in Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage Notes for BLAS DE-LA-GARZA-MONTEMAYOR and MARGARITA LOPEZ-PRIETO: Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara by Raul J. Guerra, Jr., Nadine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela, Jr. Page 48.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage Notes for BLAS DE-LA-GARZA-MONTEMAYOR and ANGELA MENDEZ-DE-TOVAR-HIDALGO: Origin de los Fundadores de Texas, Nuevo Mexico, Coahuila, y Nuevo Leon, by Guillermo Garmendia Leal. Page 58.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of BLAS DE-LA-GARZA-MONTEMAYOR and MARGARITA LOPEZ-PRIETO are:
