2 CONC him. It appears that Juan's birth date and death date have been mistaken for his son Gonzalo's birth and death date, which are 1598-1645/6 according to https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Fern%C3%A1ndez_de_Castro-12 and https://genealog
2 CONC ias.wordpress.com/2007/11/14/genealogiaorgmx-14734-don-hernando-de-castro/
