2 CONT *He married 7. Clara Chapa Baez Benavides 7-30-1718 in Cerralvo NL. 
2 CONT **7. Clara Chapa Baez Benavides, born in Monterrey; died Bef. 1750. She was the daughter of 14. Capitán Nicolas Chapa Olivares de Treviño and 15. Inés Benavides Báez Flores. 
