2 CONT ==================
2 CONT
2 CONT Maria de TREVIÑO was born (date unknown). Parents: Alferez Melchor de TREVIÑO and Laureana DIAZ.
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Vicente de ZALDIVAR. Maria de TREVIÑO and Vicente de ZALDIVAR were married after 6 September 1686.[3025]
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Capt. Phelipe de ERIBE. Children were: 
2 CONT *1. Isabel de ERIBE, 
2 CONT *2. Maria de ERIBE, 
2 CONT *3. Juan Antonio ERIBE, 
2 CONT *4. Francisco Xavier de ERIBE, 
2 CONT *5. Maria Rosa de ERIBE, 
2 CONT *6. Catarina de ERIBE (Uribe).
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.raullongoria.net/Genealogy/FamilyTree/b220.html#P1158
2 CONT
2 CONT ======================
2 CONT
2 CONT 62.  Maria Diaz De La Garza FALCON (Melchor Gonzales De La Garza, Marcos Alonso Trevino De La Garza, Marcos Alonzo Garza Y del Arcon) 
2 CONT *was born 1669. 
2 CONT *She died 1755.
2 CONT *Maria married Felipe De La Garza Falcon URIBE1, son of Antonio Pacheco URIBE and Luisa Gonzales De La Garza FALCON. Felipe was born 1666.
2 CONT
2 CONT They had the following children:
2 CONT *1. 90 F i. Catarina De La Garza Falcon URIBE is printed as #67 on page 6.
2 CONT *2. 91 F ii. Maria Isabel De La Garza Falcon Diaz URIBE is printed as #68 on page 6.
2 CONT *3. 92 F iii. Maria Francisca De La Garza Falcon URIBE is printed as #69 on page 6.
2 CONT *4. 93 F iv. Maria Rosa De La Garza Falcon URIBE is printed as #70 on page 6.
2 CONT *5. 94 M v. Jose Luis Francisco De La Garza Falcon URIBE is printed as #71 on page 6.
2 CONT
