1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 46. JOSEPHA4 DE MORALES (RODRIGO3 DE MORALES-TREVINO, JUANA2 DE TREVINO-QUINTANILLA-Y-SALAZAR, PEDRO1 DE SALAZAR) 
2 CONT *was born 1653 in Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico. 
2 CONT *She married CAPTAIN NICOLAS FLORES-DE-ABREGO 13 Nov 1682 in Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico, 
2 CONT **son of NICOLAS FLORES-DE-ABREGO and JUANA-GERTRUDIS DE FARIAS-GARCIA. He was born 1651 in Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of JOSEPHA DE MORALES and NICOLAS FLORES-DE-ABREGO are:
2 CONT *1. i. DIEGO FRANCISCO5 FLORES-DE-ABREGO, 
2 CONT **m. EFIGENIA FLORES-GOMEZ, 10 Oct 1727, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT ***Marriage Notes for DIEGO FLORES-DE-ABREGO and EFIGENIA FLORES-GOMEZ: Marriage source:Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara by Raul J. Guerra, Jr., Nadine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela, Jr. Page 249.
2 CONT *2. ii. MATEO FLORES-DE-ABREGO, 
2 CONT **b. Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico; 
2 CONT **m. FELIPA FLORES-GOMEZ, 11 Dec 1727, Saltillo, Coahulia, Mexico; 
2 CONT ***b. Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico.
2 CONT ****Marriage Notes for MATEO FLORES-DE-ABREGO and FELIPA FLORES-GOMEZ: Marriage source:Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara by Raul J. Guerra, Jr., Nadine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela, Jr. Page 248.
2 CONT *3. iii. ANA-MARIA FLORES-DE-ABREGO, 
2 CONT **b. Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico; 
2 CONT **m. CAPTAIN JUAN FLORES-DE-VALDEZ-CEPEDA, 20 Aug 1714, Saltillo, Coahulia, Mexico; 
2 CONT ***b. 1685, Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico.
2 CONT ****Marriage Notes for ANA-MARIA FLORES-DE-ABREGO and JUAN FLORES-DE-VALDEZ-CEPEDA: Marriage source:Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara by Raul J. Guerra, Jr., Nadine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela, Jr. 
2 CONC Page 70.
2 CONT *4. iv. MARSELA FLORES-DE-ABREGO, 
2 CONT **m. BUENAVENTURA DE-LA-PAZ-ABREGO, 05 Aug 1719, Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico.
