1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 1. Don JUAN-FRANCISCO1 MARTINEZ-GUAJARDO 
2 CONT *was born Abt. 1565, and 
2 CONT *died 1607. 
2 CONT *He married Dona URSULA-INES-CATARINA NAVARRO-RODRIGUEZ Abt. 1600, daughter of Don JUAN NAVARRO and Dona MARIA RODRIGUEZ-DE-SOSA. She was born 1581.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for JUAN-FRANCISCO MARTINEZ-GUAJARDO:
2 CONT
2 CONT Source:
2 CONT *With All Arms by Carl Laurence Duaine. Page 241.
2 CONT *Origen de los Fundadores de Texas, Muevo Mexico, Coahuila y Nuevo Leon, Saltillo Tomo II by
2 CONT *Guillermo Garmendia Leal. Page 56.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of JUAN-FRANCISCO MARTINEZ-GUAJARDO and URSULA-INES-CATARINA NAVARRO-RODRIGUEZ are:
2 CONT *1. 2. i. CATALINA2 MARTINEZ-GUAJARDO.
2 CONT *2. 3. ii. CAPTAIN IGNACIO MARTINEZ-GUAJARDO-NAVARRO, b. Santiago del Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico.
2 CONT *3. 4. iii. FRANCISCA MARTINEZ-GUAJARDO-NAVARRO-RODRIGUEZ, b. 1580; d. Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico.
2 CONT *4. 5. iv. MARIA-INES RODRIGUEZ-MARTINEZ-GUAJARDO, b. 1585, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *5. 6. v. ISABEL MARTINEZ-GUAJARDO-NAVARRO, b. 1606; d. July 25, 1693, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *6. 7. vi. ALFEREZ REAL JUAN MARTINEZ-GUAJARDO, b. 1607; d. Bef. 1664, Saltillo, Coahulia, Mexico.
2 CONT *7. 8. vii. LORENZO MARTINEZ-GUAJARDO-NAVARRO, b. 1610; d. Bef. 1664, Saltillo, Coahulia, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.somosprimos.com/inclan/guajardo.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Francisco MARTINEZ GUAJARDO [432] was born (date unknown).
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Ines (Ursula) Rodriguez NAVARRO (aka Ursula Catarina Navarro). Ines (Ursula) Rodriguez NAVARRO (aka Ursula Catarina Navarro) and Francisco MARTINEZ GUAJARDO [96],[432] were married. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children were: 
2 CONT *1. Alferez Real Juan MARTINEZ GUAJARDO, 
2 CONT *2. Francisca MARTINEZ, 
2 CONT *3. Catalina MARTINEZ Guajardo, 
2 CONT *4. Lorenzo MARTINEZ Guajardo, 
2 CONT *5. Isabel MARTINEZ Guajardo, 
2 CONT *6. Ines MARTINEZ Guajardo (aka Ines Rodriguez).
