2 CONT http://www.currays.net/Gonzalez%20Web%20Project/ps03/ps03_464.htm  ...  Martha Duron Jimenez and Ignacio Narro Etchegaray.  ''DICCIONARIO BIOGRAFICO DE SALTILLO'', Mayo 1995, page 109  ...  '''Francisco MARTINEZ GUAJARDO''':  His 
2 CONC origin is unknown. He '''married Dona Ines RODRiGUEZ NAVARRO''', daughter of Capitan Don Juan NAVARRO and Dona Maria RODRiGUEZ. Their '''children were''' Catharina, Ines, Juan, Isabel, '''Francisca''' and Lorenzo MARTINEZ GUAJARDO
2 CONC  RODRiGUEZ NAVARRO. According to the census of 1604, ordered by URDINOLA, Francisco Martin GUAJARDO was the proprietor of a labor de coger pan y maiz (wheat and corn farm), in the Villa de Santiago del Saltillo, possibly, the Haci
2 CONC enda de San Nicolas de los Berros or of San Juan Bautista. In 1612, he was regidor (alderman) of Saltillo; in 1615, he was lieutenant to the Alcalde Mayor of Saltillo. He was the first MARTINEZ GUAJARDO who appears in Nueva Vizcay
2 CONC a.
