2 CONT Beatriz de las CASAS895 was born in 1604.895 She died in 1674 at the age of 70.895 Parents: Bernabe de las CASAS and Beatriz NAVARRO.
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Capt. Diego de VILLARREAL. Beatriz de las CASAS and Capt. Diego de VILLARREAL896 were married. Children were: Sgt. Major Diego de VILLARREAL, Capt. Juan Bautista de VILLARREAL, Capt. Bernabe de VILLARREAL, Capt. Juan de VI
2 CONC LLARREAL, Francisco de VILLARREAL, Capt. Cristobal de VILLARREAL, Luisa de VILLARREAL (aka Luisa de las Casas).
