2 CONC  exp. 53, fol. 37].  ...  This protocolo deals with an inheritance sale and cites '''Diego Fernández de Montemayor's wife Juliana de las Casas, her sister Beatriz de las Casas, her sister's husband Captain Diego Villarreal, as wel
2 CONC l as Juliana's parents Captain Bernabé de las Casas and his wife Beatriz Navarro'''.  It is dated March 8, 1654.
