2 CONT 6. ANDRES4 RAMON-CAMACHO (DIEGO3 RAMON, JOSEPH2 DE MORALES-Y-RAMON, LUIS1 RAMON-DE-MORALES) was born 1670 in San Juan Bautista del Rio Grande, Coahulia, Mexico. He married (1) MARIA-LUISA GARCIA-FLORES, daughter of JACINTO GARCIA-
