1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Maria Juana FLORES de Valdes383,1703 was born (date unknown). Several marriage investigations name Isabel Garcia's mother as Maria Flores (one names her as Maria Flores de Valdes); those investigations combine to n
2 CONC ame some of Maria's siblings as Yldefonsa Flores, Luisa Flores, Juan Flores de Valdes, Diego Flores, Alvaro Flores and Nicolas de Valle. However, marriage investigation #23-18 names Isabel Garcia's mother as Juana Flores, sister o
2 CONC f Isabel Flores. Therefore, it would appear Isabel Garcia's mother was named either Maria Juana Flores or Juana Maria Flores, and I have chosen to show her name as Maria Juana Flores de Valdes. Given the names of her siblings, the
2 CONC re is little doubt Maria Juana's parents were Capt. Rodrigo Flores de Valdes and Maria Isabel de Treviño Salazar. One of this latter couple's children was a Maria Flores who was married to Ignacio Martinez. It is possible this chi
2 CONC ld named Maria Flores was the same person as the sibling I have chosen to show as Maria Juana Flores. But I couldn't find any clues to support the notion that they were the same person, thus reinforcing my decision to show them as
2 CONC  two persons and naming the second Maria Juana Flores to distinguish her from the first Maria Flores. Parents: Capt. Rodrigo FLORES de Valdes and Maria Isabel de Trevino SALAZAR (aka Maria de Treviño).
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Alferez Lorenzo GARCIA. Maria Juana FLORES de Valdes and Alferez Lorenzo GARCIA were married. Children were: Isabel GARCIA, Juana GARCIA.
2 CONT
