2 CONT *Spouse: Maria de ABREGO (aka Maria Guillen de Abrego). Maria de ABREGO (aka Maria Guillen de Abrego) and Diego FLORES de VALDES were married. Children were: 
2 CONT **1. Diego FLORES de VALDES, 
2 CONT **2. Gertrudis FLORES de Valdes, 
2 CONT **3. Capt. Miguel FLORES de VALDES (aka Miguel Valdes), 
2 CONT **4. Capt. Francisco FLORES de Valdes (aka Francisco Valdes), 
2 CONT **5. Pedro FLORES de VALDES (aka Pedro Valdes), 
2 CONT **6. Josepha FLORES de Valdes (aka Josepha Valdes), 
2 CONT **7. Antonia FLORES de Valdes (aka Antonia de Valdes), 
2 CONT **8. Maria FLORES, 
2 CONT **9. Juana FLORES de VALDES.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.raullongoria.net/Genealogy/FamilyTree/b71.html#P7645
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT 14. DIEGO3 FLORES-DE-VALDEZ-SALAZAR (MARIA-ISABEL2 DE SALAZAR-Y-TREVINO, PEDRO1 DE SALAZAR) 
2 CONT *was born in Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico. 
2 CONT *He married MARIA GUILLEN-DE-ABREGO-GONZALEZ, 
2 CONT **daughter of DOMINGO GONZALEZ-NAVARRO and MARIA DE ABREGO. She was born in Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico.
2 CONT
