2 CONT And in-law to Don Juan Perez de Oñate. Don Juan Guerra was a Silver baron from Zacatecas. Financial backer of the 1598 Oñate entrada unto New Mexico. In 1599, during the second expedition into New Mexico, he was named lieutenant g
2 CONC overnor and captain general by Don Juan Perez de Oñate. Source: From the book's; Land of the Conquistadores by Cleve Hallenbeck.
