2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Isabel DE LA GARZA (aka Isabel Gonzalez). Isabel DE LA GARZA (aka Isabel Gonzalez) and Capt. Nicolas de OCHOA de Elejalde (del Ejalde) were married. Children were: 
