1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://gw5.geneanet.org/sanchiz?lang=en;pz=tomas;nz=sanchez+garza;ocz=0;p=antonio;n=uribe+de+la+cadena+vergara
2 CONT
2 CONT Married to Luisa Garza-Falcón González-Hidalgo 1636-1682 (Parents : Blas María Garza-Falcón Treviño ca 1591-1669 &  Beatriz González-Hidalgo Navarro ca 1597-1670) , 
2 CONT * Josefa Uribe de la Cadena Garza 1665
2 CONT * Andres Uribe de la Cadena Garza 1668
2 CONT * Juan Uribe de la Cadena Garza
2 CONT
2 CONT Married to María Isabel Lobo-Guerrero Casas, ■Felipe Uribe de la Cadena Lobo
2 CONT * Antonio Uribe de la Cadena Lobo 
2 CONT
2 CONT =============================
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. ANTONIO3 URIBE-DE-LA-CADENA-VERGARA (JOSE2 URIBE-Y-VERGARA-TOVAR, PEDRO1 URIBE-Y-VERGARA) 
2 CONT *was born in Wichapan, Mexico F.D., Mexico, and 
2 CONT *died May 27, 1678 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. 
2 CONT *He married (1) MARIA-ISABEL LOBO-GUERRERO-DE-LAS-CASAS 1648, 
2 CONT **daughter of JUAN-ALONSO LOBO-GUERRERO-FERNANDEZ-CORDOVA and MARIA DE-LAS-CASAS-NAVARRO. 
2 CONT *He married (2) LUISA DE-LA-GARZA-GONZALEZ 1658 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, 
2 CONT **daughter of BLAS DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON-TREVINO and BEATRIZ GONZALEZ-HIDALGO-NAVARRO. She was born Abt. 1633 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, and 
2 CONT **died April 13, 1682 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for ANTONIO URIBE-DE-LA-CADENA-VERGARA:
2 CONT *A.K.A. Antonio de la Cadena Vergara. Source:Origen de los Fundadores de Texas, Nuevo Mexico, Coahuila y Nuevo Leon, Saltillo Tomo II, by Guillermo Garmendia Leal. Page 11.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for LUISA DE-LA-GARZA-GONZALEZ:
2 CONT *A.K.A. Luisa de Trevino.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of ANTONIO URIBE-DE-LA-CADENA-VERGARA and MARIA-ISABEL LOBO-GUERRERO-DE-LAS-CASAS are:
2 CONT *1. 4. i. ANTONIO4 DE-LA-CADENA-LOBO, 
2 CONT **b. Wichapan, Mexico F.D. Mexico.
2 CONT *2. ii. NICOLAS DE-LA-CADENA-LOBO, 
2 CONT **m. MARIA DE LA CONCEPCION, 1680.
2 CONT *3. 5. iii. AUGUSTINA DE URIBE-DE-LA-CADENA-LOBO, 
2 CONT **b. 1660, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *4. 6. iv. CAPTAIN PHELIPE DE URIBE-DE-LA-CADENA-LOBO, 
2 CONT **b. 1666, Wichapan, Mexico F.D. Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of ANTONIO URIBE-DE-LA-CADENA-VERGARA and LUISA DE-LA-GARZA-GONZALEZ are:
2 CONT *1. v. BEATRICE4 URIBE-DE-LA-CADENA, 
2 CONT **m. COMMANDER JUAN-FRANCISCO RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR, 1685; 
2 CONT ***b. 1629.
2 CONT *2. vi. JOSEPHA URIBE-DE-LA-CADENA-VERGARA, 
2 CONT **b. 1665, Salinas Victoria, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; 
2 CONT **m. (1) CAPTAIN NICOLAS GUTIERREZ-DE-LARA, April 12, 1690, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; 
2 CONT ***b. 1645, Queretaro, Queretaro, Mexico; 
2 CONT **m. (2) FRANCISCO LONGORIA-RODRIGUEZ, January 25, 1695, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; 
2 CONT ***b. Abt. 1652, Salinas Victoria, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT ****Marriage Notes for JOSEPHA URIBE-DE-LA-CADENA-VERGARA and NICOLAS GUTIERREZ-DE-LARA: Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara by Raul J. Guerra, Jr., Nadine M. Vasquez, Valdomero Vela, Jr. Page 33.
2 CONT ****Marriage Notes for JOSEPHA URIBE-DE-LA-CADENA-VERGARA and FRANCISCO LONGORIA-RODRIGUEZ: Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara by Raul J. Guerra, Jr., Nadine M. Vasquez, Valdomero Vela, Jr. Page 41.
2 CONT *3. 7. vii. MARIA URIBE-DE-LA-CADENA-VERGARA, 
2 CONT **b. 1665.
2 CONT *4. viii. ANDRES URIBE-DE-LA-CADENA-DE-LA-GARZA, 
2 CONT **b. December 25, 1668, Sagrario Metro, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *5. 8. ix. JUANA URIBE-DE-LA-CADENA-DE-LA-GARZA, 
2 CONT **b. 1678, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *6. 9. x. TOMASINA URIBE-DE-LA-CADENA-DE-LA-GARZA, 
2 CONT **b. 1672; 
2 CONT **d. May 23, 1749, Sabinas Hidalgo, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *7. 10. xi. JUAN URIBE-DE-LA-CADENA-VERGARA, 
2 CONT **b. January 23, 1674, Sagrario Metro, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *8. 11. xii. FRANCISCO URIBE-DE-LA-CADENA-VERGARA, 
2 CONT **b. 1675.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.somosprimos.com/inclan/uribe.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
