1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 5. AUGUSTINA4 DE URIBE-DE-LA-CADENA-LOBO (ANTONIO3 URIBE-DE-LA-CADENA-VERGARA, JOSE2 URIBE-Y-VERGARA-TOVAR, PEDRO1 URIBE-Y-VERGARA) was born 1660 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. She married JUAN FERNANDEZ-DE-CAST
2 CONC RO-Y-DE-LA-CERDA June 10, 1680 in Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, son of DIEGO FERNANDEZ-DE-CASTRO-RODRIGUEZ and ANA-MARIA DE-LA-CERDA-Y-PORCALLO. He was born 1655, and died 1702.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for AUGUSTINA DE URIBE-DE-LA-CADENA-LOBO:
2 CONT
2 CONT A.K.A. Augustina Cadena and Augustina Iribe de la Cadena.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage Notes for AUGUSTINA DE URIBE-DE-LA-CADENA-LOBO and JUAN FERNANDEZ-DE-CASTRO-Y-DE-LA-CERDA: Mil Familias III by Rodolfo Gonzalez de la Garza. Page 463.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of AUGUSTINA DE URIBE-DE-LA-CADENA-LOBO and JUAN FERNANDEZ-DE-CASTRO-Y-DE-LA-CERDA are:
2 CONT
2 CONT 12. i. JACINTA5 FERNANDEZ-DE-CASTRO, b. 1680.
2 CONT
2 CONT ii. ANTONIO FERNANDEZ-URIBE, b. July 18, 1681, Sagrario Metro, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT iii. CHRISTOBAL GEORGE FERNANDEZ-URIBE, b. October 16, 1686, Sagrario Metro, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT 13. iv. PEDRO-MACARIO FERNANDEZ-DE-CASTRO, b. 1692.
2 CONT
2 CONT 14. v. MARIA JOSEFA FERNANDEZ-URIBE, b. 1696, Hacienda de Santo Domingo, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT 15. vi. CAPTAIN JUAN-DIMAS FERNANDEZ-DE-CASTRO-URIBE, b. March 01, 1697, Villa de Pesqueria Grande, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; d. Bef. 1750.
2 CONT
2 CONT 16. vii. ANTONIO FERNANDEZ-CADENA, b. 1700; d. Aft. August 03, 1751, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT viii. JOSEPH ANTONIO FERNANDEZ-URIBE, b. January 19, 1730, Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
