2 CONT CAPTAIN PHELIPE4 DE URIBE-DE-LA-CADENA-LOBO (ANTONIO3 URIBE-DE-LA-CADENA-VERGARA, JOSE2 URIBE-Y-VERGARA-TOVAR, PEDRO1 URIBE-Y-VERGARA) 
2 CONT *was born 1666 in Wichapan, Mexico F.D. Mexico. 
2 CONT *He married MARIA DE TREMINO-DIAZ-NAVARRO Abt. 1690, 
2 CONT **daughter of MELCHOR DE TREMINO-GONZALEZ-HIDALGO and LAUREANA DIAZ-BOTELLO. She was born 1669 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, and 
2 CONT **died February 1755.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of PHELIPE DE URIBE-DE-LA-CADENA-LOBO and MARIA DE TREMINO-DIAZ-NAVARRO are:
2 CONT *1. 18. i. MARIA-ROSA5 DE URIBE-TREVINO.
2 CONT *2. 19. ii. ISABEL DE URIBE-TREVINO, 
2 CONT **b. 1690, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *3. 20. iii. FRANCISCO-JAVIER DE URIBE, 
2 CONT **b. 1708, Carrizal. Nuevo Leon,Mexico; 
2 CONT **d. October 01, 1769, Revilla, Tamaulipas, Mexico.
2 CONT *4. 21. iv. CATALINA DE URIBE-TREVINO, 
2 CONT **b. Bet. 1708 - 1709.
2 CONT *5. v. MARIA-FRANCISCA DE URIBE-TREVINO, 
2 CONT **m. (1) ONOFRE GONZALEZ-DE-QUINTANILLA, August 15, 1710, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; 
2 CONT **m. (2) ANTONIO DE SALDUA-MAGUREGUI, February 05, 1712, Sagrario Metro, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage Notes for MARIA-FRANCISCA DE URIBE-TREVINO and ONOFRE GONZALEZ-DE-QUINTANILLA: Mil Familias III by Rodolfo Gonzalez de la Garza. Page 188.
