2 CONT
2 CONT i. FRANCISCO JAVIER4 FLORES-DE-ABREGO-Y-CEPEDA.
2 CONT
2 CONT ii. BALTAZAR FLORES-DE-ABREGO-Y-CEPEDA.
2 CONT
2 CONT 11. iii. LAZARO FLORES-DE-ABREGO-Y-CEPEDA.
2 CONT
2 CONT 12. iv. MARIA FLORES-DE-ABREGO, b. 1676, Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT v. ANTONIA FLORES-DE-ABREGO-Y-CEPEDA, b. 1687; m. LUIS FARIAS-AGUIRRE, April 20, 1705, Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico; b. 1685.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for LUIS FARIAS-AGUIRRE: Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara, by Raul J. Guerra., Nadine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela, Jr. Page 282
2 CONT
