1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Juan Antonio DE LA GARZA FALCON1151,1367,1419 was born (date unknown). I have concluded that Juan Antonio de la Garza's first two wives were both named Francisca de Villarreal. The two Francisca's were first cousin
