2 CONT
2 CONT 116. CAPTAIN SANTIAGO4 DE TREVINO-DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY (FRANCISCO3 BAEZ-DE-TREVINO-SALAZAR, ANA2 DE SALAZAR-TREVINO, PEDRO1 DE SALAZAR)25 
2 CONT *was born 1660 in Saltillo, Coahulia, Mexico, and 
2 CONT *died in Cadereyta Jimenez, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. 
2 CONT *He married (1) MARIA-CATARINA DE AYALA-Y-TREVINO 29 Jul 1688 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico26, 
2 CONT **daughter of ALONSO DE TREMINO-GONZALEZ and CATALINA DE AYALA-BENAVIDES. She was born 24 Sep 1668 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. 
2 CONT *He married (2) LEONOR DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON-GARCIA 19 Jun 1690 in Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico27, 
2 CONT **daughter of FRANCISCO DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON-TREVINO and JUANA GUTIERREZ-DE-BAEZA-GARCIA. She was born 1664 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, and 
2 CONT **died in Cadereyta Jimenez, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT ***Marriage Notes for SANTIAGO DE TREVINO-DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY and MARIA-CATARINA DE AYALA-Y-TREVINO: Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara by Raul J. Guerra, Jr., Nadine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela, Jr. P
2 CONC age 67.[#16-5]. LDS Film #0167990
2 CONT ***Marriage Notes for SANTIAGO DE TREVINO-DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY and LEONOR DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON-GARCIA: Source:Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara, page 28. [5-1]. Marriage record from the LDS microfilm #6
2 CONC 05,179.
2 CONT
