2 CONC  Navarro, the daughter of Don JuanNavarro, a founder of Saltillo. Beatriz was the first wife of CaptainAlonso de Sosa Albornoz, killed in New Mexico by orders of OÃ±ate.Alonsoâ™s grandfather was the Conquistador Don AndrÃ©s de Tap
2 CONC ia,perhaps the most trustworthy and reliable of the captains of theMarquis del Valle de Oaxaca, HernÃ¡n CortÃ©s. See A History of NewMexico by Gaspar Perez de Villagra, Alcala - 1610, translated byGilberto Espinosa.
