1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Clara de VALLE1632 was born (1632) In Monterrey, N.L.. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Clara de Valle was a sister of Diego Flores de Valdes. She is the daughter of Nicolas de Valle Flores de Valdes y Salazar and Maria de la Pena. She is the granddaughter of Capt Rodrigo Flores and Maria Isabel de Salazar y Trevino.
2 CONC  Capt Rodrigo was born in Villa de Cangas, Tineo, Asturias, Spain.
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Diego SAENZ. Clara de VALLE and Diego SAENZ were married. Children were: (7) Capt Joseph, Jose Diego Jr., Jose Domingo, Maria Micaela (twin) & Jose Miguel (twin), Maria Severa, and Maria Juana.  
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.raullongoria.net/Genealogy/FamilyTree/b224.html#P10181
2 CONT
2 CONT "Capt Miguel Sanchez Saenz and His Descendants" by Joel Rene Escobar y Saenz. 286 pp.
