2 CONT *was born 1603 in Lepe, Huelva, Spain, and 
2 CONT *died February 02, 1677/78 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. 
2 CONT *He married MARIA DURAN-DE-VZCANGA Abt. 1625 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, 
2 CONT **daughter of ANTONIO DURAN-DE-VZCANGA and CATALINA DE TREVINO-AYALA. She was born 1605.
