2 CONC Munguía on July 27, 1695, at the Metropolitan Chapel, Monterrey, Nuevo León. (M601491-0321) They had one son from this union: A) Juan Joseph Chapa Munguía who was born March 24, 1710. (C601491-2104) II. Nicolás Chapa married Inés 
