2 CONC  Mier, Tamaulipas. 6). José Leonardo Chapa who died at 23 years of age on May 14, 1772. 7). José Santiago Chapa who first married María Juana Hinojosa on January 22, 1777, at Mier, Tamaulipas. 8). María Luisa Chapa who married Jos
