2 CONC , Tamaulipas. 2). María Gerarda Hinojosa who married José Miguel Sáenz on April 4, 1785, at Mier, Tamaulipas. 3). Manuel Hinojosa, who was 19 in the Camargo census of May 31, 1750. C) Antonia Chapa married José Salinas. D) Clara M
