2 CONC  married María Agustina García 18 November, 1770, at Mier, Tamaulipas. 4). María Antonia Gertrudis Chapa (3) who married José María Escobar Nov. 29, 1770, at Mier, Tamaulipas. 5). María Ignacia Chapa who was 2 in 1753. III. Gaspar
2 CONC  Chapa was born in 1674 and died on January 8, 1694. He never married but lived in common law with María González and they had at least one child when Sergeant Gaspar Chapa was stationed in Saltillo, Coahuila: A) Pedro Chapa marri
