2 CONT viii. Juana Porcallo de la Cerda (Source: Cuban Genealogical Society, "Revista," Vol. I, April 1988, No. 2, p. 34.), married Diego de Montemayor 1569 (Source: Cuban Genealogical Society, "Revista," Vol. I, April 1988, No. 2, p. 34
2 CONC .).
