1 NOTE {geni:about_me} CAPTAIN BLAS4 CANALES-MONTEMAYOR (JUAN3 CANALES, JOSE2, ANTONIO1) 
2 CONT *was born 1676 in Cerralvo, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, and 
2 CONT *died in Cerralvo, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. 
2 CONT *He married MARIA BAEZ-DE-BENAVIDES-Y-DE-LOS-REYES, 
2 CONT **daughter of BERNARDO BAEZ-DE-BENAVIDES-Y-MARTINEZ and FRANCISCA DE-LOS-REYES-PONCE. She was born 1680 in Cerralvo, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of BLAS CANALES-MONTEMAYOR and MARIA BAEZ-DE-BENAVIDES-Y-DE-LOS-REYES are:
2 CONT *1. 3. i. JUAN-ANTONIO-BAUTISTA5 CANALES-BENAVIDES, 
2 CONT **d. Aft. February 14, 1780, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *2. ii. BERNARDO CANALES-BENAVIDES.
2 CONT *3. iii. FRANCISCA CANALES-BENAVIDES.
2 CONT *4. iv. JOSE CANALES-BENAVIDES, 
2 CONT **m. RAFAELA ANTONIA DEL BOSQUE.
2 CONT *5. 4. v. MICHAELA CANALES-BENAVIDES, 
2 CONT **b. Cerralvo, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; 
2 CONT **d. January 29, 1774, Cerralvo, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *6. 5. vi. MARIA-GERTRUDIS CANALES-BENAVIDES, 
2 CONT **b. 1714; 
2 CONT **d. December 22, 1784, Mier, Tamaulipas, Mexico.
2 CONT *7. vii. TEODORA CANALES-BENAVIDES.
2 CONT *8. viii. ROSALIA CANALES-BENAVIDES.
2 CONT *9. 6. ix. JOSE-SALVADOR CANALES-BENAVIDES, 
2 CONT **b. Cerralvo, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; 
2 CONT **d. December 04, 1768.
2 CONT *10. 7. x. JOSE-BLAS CANALES-BENAVIDAS, 
2 CONT **b. Abt. 1710, Cerralvo, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; 
2 CONT **d. December 07, 1780, Cerralvo, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *11. xi. GREGORIA CANALES-BENAVIDES, 
2 CONT **b. 1720; 
2 CONT **m. SALVADOR PINEDA, October 1753.
2 CONT ***Notes for GREGORIA CANALES-BENAVIDES: Source: Mil Familias III by Rodolfo Gonzalez de la Garza, page 103.
