1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Catarina RODRIGUEZ de Montemayor155,495,2507 was born (date unknown). Parents: Capt. Francisco RODRIGUEZ de Montemayor and Maria BARRERA.
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Juan Antonio TAMEZ. Catarina RODRIGUEZ de Montemayor and Juan Antonio TAMEZ were married after 11 August 1708.495 Children were: Antonio Pantaleon de TAMEZ, Juana Josepha TAMEZ.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.raullongoria.net/Genealogy/FamilyTree/b188.html#P9147
