2 CONC o Leon, Mexico. He married JUANA-MICHAELA RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR 16 Nov 1735 in Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, daughter of JOSEPH RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR and MARIA-SARAGOSA RUIZ-DE-OCON. She was born in Mo
2 CONC nterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
