2 CONT Joseph RAMON (Joseph de Morales)183,2103,2578 was born (date unknown). Because his offspring would otherwise be Morales de Morales, Joseph de Morales adopted the surname Ramon to distinguish his family from the other Morales famil
2 CONC ies and he became Joseph Ramon. Parents: Capt. Luis de MORALES and Juana de Trevino SALAZAR.
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Juana de MORALES (aka Juana Gutierrez). Juana de MORALES (aka Juana Gutierrez) and Joseph RAMON (Joseph de Morales) were married about 1648.2103 Children were: Capt. Joseph RAMON, Ildephonsa (Aldonsa) RAMON, Nicolas RAMON,
2 CONC  Diego RAMON, Juana RAMON, Maria Jacinta RAMON, Maria RAMON.
2 CONT
