2 CONT outline of 5 generations of descendants - http://www.vsalgs.org/stnemgenealogy/vguerra.html
2 CONT ====================
2 CONT 68. CAPTAIN VICENTE5 GUERRA-CANAMAR-CAVAZOS (ELENA4 CAVAZOS-MONTEMAYOR, ANTONIO3 CAVAZOS-DE-LA-GARZA, JUAN2 CAVAZOS-DEL-CAMPO, GABRIEL1 CAVAZOS) was born 02 Aug 1705 in Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, and di
2 CONC ed Bef. 1753 in Guerrero Viejo, Tamaulipas, Mexico. He married MARIA-MICAELA-GERONIMA DE-LA-GARZA-QUINTANILLA 15 Feb 1732 in Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, daughter of THEODORO DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON-SEPULVEDA 
2 CONC and MARIA GONZALEZ-DE-QUINTANILLA. She was born 29 Sep 1706 in Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, and died 01 Jun 1780 in Guerrero Viejo, Tamaulipas, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for CAPTAIN VICENTE GUERRA-CANAMAR-CAVAZOS: Founder of Revilla, Tamaulipas, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT He and his family are listed on the 1750 and 1753 census, Guerrero Viejo (Revilla), Tamaulipas,
2 CONT
2 CONT Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for MARIA-MICAELA-GERONIMA DE-LA-GARZA-QUINTANILLA:
2 CONT
2 CONT She is listed as widowed on the 1780 census, Guerrero Viejo, Tamaulipas, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of VICENTE GUERRA-CANAMAR-CAVAZOS and MARIA-MICAELA-GERONIMA DE-LA-GARZA-QUINTANILLA are:
2 CONT
2 CONT 206. i. JOSE-ANTONIO6 GUERRA-CANAMAR-DE-LA-GARZA, b. 16 Nov 1732, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; d. 07 Nov 1802, Revilla, Tamaulipas, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT 207. ii. JOSEPH NICOLAS GUERRA-CANAMAR-DE-LA-GARZA, b. 1739; d. Bef. 1780, Guerrero, Tamaulipas, Mexico.
2 CONT
