1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 3. SERGENT BERNARDO2 DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY (JUAN1 DE CALIZ) was born 1590 in Lepe, Huelva, Spain, and died 1675 in Dueno Hada. S. Ididro O.. He married (1) MARIA-INES DE-LA-CERDA-Y-CASTRO, daughter of FERNANDO DE-LA-CE
2 CONC RDA and ISABEL DE CASTRO. She was born 1590. He married (2) BEATRIZ ROJO-DE-LAS-RUELAS 1622, daughter of SANTOS ROJO and BEATRIZ DE-LAS-RUELAS-NAVARRO. She died in Saltillo, Coahulia, Mexico.
2 CONT
