1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Cavazos Garza, Israel.  '''''Catálogo y Síntesis de los Protocolos del Archivo Municipal de Monterrey 1786-1795''''', Monterrey, Nuevo León, México, 1988, pages 54-55, #2949 [XX, fol. 291, 158].  ...  This protocol
2 CONC o is the '''will of Nicolás de los Santos Coy''' and presented by '''his widow Ana María Guerra''' and '''his daughter María Josefa de los Santos Coy'''.  The location and description of his burial are set forth, his spouse and da
2 CONC ughter are named, the disposition of his various properties, goods, debts, and monies as well as the establishment of a chaplaincy are ordered.  '''His parents José de los Santos Coy and María Méndez Tovar Hidalgo''' as well as ''
2 CONC 'those of his wife, Antonio Guerra and Antonia de la Garza''', are cited.  Witnesses are listed.  '''Villa de San Carlos, 6 de Febrero de 1789'''.
