2 CONT **1. Maria de VILLARREAL, 
2 CONT **2. Miguel de VILLARREAL.
2 CONT *Spouse: Ildefonsa (Aldonza) MARTINEZ Guajardo. Ildefonsa (Aldonza) MARTINEZ Guajardo and Capt. Cristobal de VILLARREAL were married after 17 June 1690.[152] 
