1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 33. JUANA4 GARCIA-FLORES-DE-VALDEZ (PEDRO3 DE-LOS-SANTOS-DE-ROJO-RUELAS, BERNARDO2 DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY, JUAN1 DE CALIZ) She married CAPTAIN ALONZO DE CEPEDA-HERRERA, 
2 CONT *son of ALONSO DE CEPEDA-DE-LA-FUENTE and BERNARDA DE HERRERA. 
2 CONT *He died Abt. 1705 in Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico.
2 CONT *Notes for JUANA GARCIA-FLORES-DE-VALDEZ: A.K.A. Juana de Valle.
2 CONT **Notes for CAPTAIN ALONZO DE CEPEDA-HERRERA: Origen de los Fundadores de Texas, Nuevo Mexico, Coagulia y Nuevo Leon, Saltillo Tomo II by Guillermo Garmendia Leal. Page 101.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of JUANA GARCIA-FLORES-DE-VALDEZ and ALONZO DE CEPEDA-HERRERA are:
2 CONT *1. 81. i. JOSEFA5 DE CEPEDA-GARCIA.
2 CONT *2. ii. IGNACIA DE CEPEDA-Y-VALLE, 
2 CONT **b. April 15, 1685, Sagrario Metropolitano, Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico.
2 CONT *3. 82. iii. FRANCISCA-XAVIERA DE CEPEDA-Y-VALLE, 
2 CONT **b. December 15, 1686, Sagrario Metropolitano, Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico.
2 CONT *4. iv. ANTONIO DE CEPEDA.
2 CONT *5. 83. v. MARIA DE CEPEDA.
2 CONT *6. vi. MATIAS DE CEPEDA.
2 CONT *7. vii. NICOLASA DE CEPEDA.
2 CONT *8. viii. MIGUEL DE CEPEDA, 
2 CONT **b. 1690, Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico; 
2 CONT **m. ANA DE AVILA, March 13, 1712/13, Saltillo, Coahulia, Mexico; 
2 CONT ***b. Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico.
2 CONT ****Marriage Notes for MIGUEL DE CEPEDA and ANA DE AVILA: Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara by Raul J. Guerra, Jr., Nadine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela, Jr. Page 54.
