1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 16. Matias4 Longoria Chapa (Clara3 Chapa Benavides, Nicolas2 Chapa Treviño, Juan Bautista Schiapapria1 Chapa) was born Abt 1720 in Cerralvo, and died in Camargo, Tamaulipas. He married Margarita Hinojosa Abt 1749 i
2 CONC n Cerralvo, daughter of Francisco Hinojosa Garza and Francisca Lopez de Jaen.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Matias Longoria Chapa and Margarita Hinojosa are:
2 CONT
2 CONT + 39 i. Marcelino5 Longoria Hinojosa, born Abt 1749 in Camargo, Tamaulipas; died in Matamoros, Tamaulipas.
2 CONT
2 CONT + 40 ii. Ramon Longoria Hinojosa, born Abt 1751 in Cerralvo ; died December 08, 1821 in Matamoros, Tamaulipas.
2 CONT
2 CONT + 41 iii. Gertrudis Longoria Hinojosa, born Abt 1756 in Camargo, Tamaulipas; died in Matamoros, Tamaulipas.
2 CONT
2 CONT + 42 iv. Miguel Longoria Hinojosa, born Abt 1757 in Camargo, Tamaulipas.
