2 CONT View Tree for Matias LongoriaMatias Longoria (b. Abt. 1700, d. Abt. 1755)
2 CONT
2 CONT Matias Longoria (son of Cpt. Juan Diego Longoria Garcia and Clara Maria Chapa Baez Benavidez) was born Abt. 1700 in Spain, and died Abt. 1755 in Camargo Mexico. He married Margarita De Hinojosa on Abt. 1721 in Cerralvo Mexico, dau
2 CONC ghter of Francisco De Hinojosa and Francisca Sanchez Lopez De Jaen.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Includes NotesNotes for Matias Longoria:
2 CONT
2 CONT Matias Longoria and his wife Margarita De Hinojosa and their two children can be found in the 1750 Camargo Mexico Census. Joseph Ramon is listed as a baby in arms. It also shows that Matias Longoria is the son of Diego Longoria an
2 CONC d Clara Chapa, making him the brother of Gertrudis Longoria, the wife of Tomas de Olivares.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT More About Matias Longoria and Margarita De Hinojosa:
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage: Abt. 1721, Cerralvo Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
