1 NOTE {geni:about_me} From The Descendents of Don Juan Perez de Onate and Dona Osana Martinez de Gonzalez, Compiled by John D. Inclan
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.somosprimos.com/inclan/onate.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT 81. TEODORA10 GARCIA-RODRIGUEZ (TOMAS9 GARCIA-DE-QUINTANILLA, MARIANA8 SALDIVAR-DE-SOSA, VICENTE7 DE SALDIVAR-Y-REZA, ANA-MARIA-MAGDELENA6 SALDIVAR-ONATE-MENDOZA, VICENTE5 DE SALDIVAR-Y-ONATE, MARIA4 DE ONATE, JUAN3 PEREZ-DE-ONATE
2 CONC , CRISTOBAL2 PEREZ-DE-NARRIAHONDO, PEDRO1 DE BAEZA) 
2 CONT *was born 1695. 
2 CONT *She married DIEGO SAENZ-SALDIVAR 05 Oct 1707 in Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, 
2 CONT **son of MIGUEL SAENZ-DEL-VALLE and ANTONIA DE SALDIVAR-Y-SALINAS. He was born 26 Nov 1683 in Sagrario Metro, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon,Mexico (actually, a baptismal date... the Sagrario is today the Cathedral for Monterrey), and 
2 CONT **died 09 Feb 1767 in Camargo, Tamaulipas, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for DIEGO SAENZ-SALDIVAR:
2 CONT *He is a descendent of the Don Alonso of Estrada. Royal Treasurer of New Spain. (Mexico). (Illegitimate son of Ferdinand V of Castile.)
2 CONT *Mil Familias III, by Rodolfo Gonzalez de la Garza. Page 79.
2 CONT *Source on his marriage is from the Index to the the marriage investigations of the Diocese of Guadajara, Provinces of Coahulia, Nuevo Leon, Nuevo Santander, Texas.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of TEODORA GARCIA-RODRIGUEZ and DIEGO SAENZ-SALDIVAR are:
2 CONT *1. i. SANTIAGO11 SAENZ-GARCIA.
2 CONT *2. ii. TEODORA SAENZ-GARCIA.
2 CONT *3. 146. iii. JUANA-MARIA SAENZ-GARCIA, 
2 CONT **b. 14 Aug 1709, Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *4. 147. iv. MANUELA-DE-JESUS SAENZ-GARCIA, 
2 CONT **b. 09 Jan 1715, Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *5. 148. v. MIGUEL SAENZ-GARCIA, 
2 CONT **b. 1718, Monterrery, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; 
2 CONT **d. 10 Jan 1777, Mier, Tamaulipas, Mexico.
2 CONT *6. 149. vi. MIGUEL-GERONIMO SAENZ-GARCIA, 
2 CONT **b. 15 Oct 1722, Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *7. vii. JOSEPH-BENITO SAENZ-GARCIA, 
2 CONT **b. 07 Apr 1725, Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *8. viii. JUAN GUABERTO SAENZ-GARCIA, 
2 CONT **b. 20 Oct 1728, Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *9. 150. ix. JUAN-DIEGO SAENZ-GARCIA, 
2 CONT **b. 1740, Vallecillo, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth:	Sep 26 1683 - Mier, Tamaulipas, Mexico Death:	Feb 9 1767 - Camargo, Tamaulipas, Mexico Parents:	Jose Miguel Saenz-devalle, Antonia Salinas Saenz-devalle (born De Sosa) Wife:	Teodora Saenz-saldivar (born Garcia-rodriguez) Ch
2 CONC ildren:	Jose Miguel Saenz-garcia, Capitan Miguel Sanchez Saenz
