2 CONT ***Notes for JUAN-DIEGO SAENZ-GARCIA: Mil Familias III, by Rodolfo Gonzalez de la Garza. Page 73. Source on his marriage is from the Index to the marriage investigations of the Diocese of Guadajara, Provinces of Coahulia, Nuevo Le
2 CONC on, Nuevo Santander, Texas.
2 CONT ***Notes for MARIA-CATARINA MEDINA-Y-PINA: A.K.A Catalina Medina Calancha Pena
2 CONT
