2 CONT **m. (1) MARIA JOSEFA DE-LA-GARZA; 
2 CONT **m. (2) ANA-GERTRUDIS DE IGLESIAS-Y-SANTA-CRUZ, 27 May 1732, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; 
2 CONT ***b. 1714.
2 CONT ****Marriage Notes for JUAN-JOSEPH GUERRA-FLORES and ANA-GERTRUDIS DE IGLESIAS-Y-SANTA-CRUZ: Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara by Raul J. Guerra, Jr., Nadine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela, Jr. Page 29
