2 CONT
2 CONT Micaela de AYALA387 was born (date unknown). Parents: Capt. Joseph de AYALA and Ana de BENAVIDES (aka Ana Martinez).
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Nicolas de AYALA427 was born before 5 June 1669.404 He died on 25 April 1741 at the age of 71.404 Parents: Capt. Joseph de AYALA and Ana de BENAVIDES (aka Ana Martinez).
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Agustina de TREVIÑO. Agustina de TREVIÑO and Nicolas de AYALA were married after 4 January 1692. Children were: Juan Marin de AYALA.
2 CONT
