1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 27. CAPTAIN LAZARO4 DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY-MORALES (PEDRO3 DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY-Y-DE-LA-CERDA, BERNARDO2 DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY, JUAN1 DE CALIZ) 
2 CONT *was born 1671, and 
2 CONT *died 1717. 
2 CONT *He married (1) ANA GONZALEZ-DE-QUINTANILLA. 
2 CONT *He married (2) ANGELA BERLANGA-LOBO-GUERRERO 1685, 
2 CONT **daughter of X BERLANGA and MARGARITA LOBO-GUERRERO. She was born Abt. 1673 in Guerrero, Tamaulipas, Mexico, and 
2 CONT **died 1706 in Salinas Victoria, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of LAZARO DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY-MORALES and ANA GONZALEZ-DE-QUINTANILLA is:
2 CONT *1. 70. i. AGUSTINA-CAYETANA5 DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY, 
2 CONT **b. 1708.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of LAZARO DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY-MORALES and ANGELA BERLANGA-LOBO-GUERRERO are:
2 CONT *1. 71. ii. PEDRO5 DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY-BERLANGA.
2 CONT *2. 72. iii. MARIA-EUGENIA DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY-BELANGA, 
2 CONT **b. 1678.
2 CONT *3. 73. iv. CAPTAIN LAZARO DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY-BERLANGA, 
2 CONT **b. 1690.
2 CONT *4. 74. v. FRANCISCO DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY-BERLANGA.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.somosprimos.com/inclan/santoscoy.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT 50. CAPTAIN LAZARO4 DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY-MORALES (FRANCISCA3 DE MORALES-TREVINO, JUANA2 DE TREVINO-QUINTANILLA-Y-SALAZAR, PEDRO1 DE SALAZAR) 
2 CONT *died 1717. 
2 CONT *He married (1) ANGELA BERLANGA-LOBO-GUERRERO 1685, 
2 CONT **daughter of X BERLANGA and MARGARITA LOBO-GUERRERO. She was born Abt. 1673 in Guerrero, Tamaulipas, Mexico, and 
2 CONT **died 1706 in Salinas Victoria, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. 
2 CONT *He married (2) ANA GONZALEZ-DE-QUINTANILLA-Y-FERNANDEZ 01 Sep 1710, 
2 CONT **daughter of BARTOLOME GONZALEZ-DE-QUINTANILLA and NICOLASA FERNANDEZ-DE-TIJERINA. She was born 26 Nov 1682 in Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico, and 
2 CONT **died 20 Jan 1711/12 in Tamaulipas, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of LAZARO DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY-MORALES and ANGELA BERLANGA-LOBO-GUERRERO are:
2 CONT *1. i. PEDRO5 DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY-BERLANGA, 
2 CONT **m. (1) MARIA-ANTONIA GOMEZ-RODRIGUEZ; 
2 CONT **m. (2) JUANA NICOLASA VILLARREAL.
2 CONT *2. ii. MARIA-EUGENIA DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY-BELANGA, 
2 CONT **b. 1678; 
2 CONT **m. CAPTAIN JUAN DE-LA-GARZA-DE-LA-GARZA, Salinas Victoria, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; 
2 CONT ***b. 04 Jun 1676, Sagrario Metro, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon,Mexico; 
2 CONT ***d. Abt. Jun 1714, Murdered by Indians, La Rinconadad, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *3. iii. CAPTAIN LAZARO DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY-BERLANGA, 
2 CONT **b. 1690; 
2 CONT **m. ANA-MARIA DE-LA-GARZA-CAVAZOS, 17 Aug 1715, Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; 
2 CONT ***b. 1695.
2 CONT *4. iv. FRANCISCO DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY-BERLANGA, 
2 CONT **m. MARIA-JOSEPHA-DE-JESUS DE ELIZONDO, 28 Apr 1710, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; 
2 CONT ***b. 1694, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
