1 NOTE {geni:about_me} From The Descendents of Don Juan Perez de Onate and Dona Osana Martinez de Gonzalez, Compiled by John D. Inclan
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.somosprimos.com/inclan/onate.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT 92. ANA-MARIA10 SAENZ-SALDIVAR (ANTONIA9 DE SALDIVAR-Y-SALINAS, AGUSTIN8 DE SALDIVAR-SOSA, VICENTE7 DE SALDIVAR-Y-REZA, ANA-MARIA-MAGDELENA6 SALDIVAR-ONATE-MENDOZA, VICENTE5 DE SALDIVAR-Y-ONATE, MARIA4 DE ONATE, JUAN3 PEREZ-DE-ONA
2 CONC TE, CRISTOBAL2 PEREZ-DE-NARRIAHONDO, PEDRO1 DE BAEZA) 
2 CONT *was born 31 Dec 1700 in Sagrario Metro, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon,Mexico. 
2 CONT *She married JUAN DE QUINTANILLA-FERNANDEZ-TIJERINA 09 Feb 1716 in Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, 
2 CONT **son of NICOLAS GONZALEZ-DE-QUINTANILLA-GARCIA and MARIA-BEATRIZ FERNANDEZ-DE-TIJERINA. He was born 20 Apr 1687 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT ***Notes for ANA-MARIA SAENZ-SALDIVAR: Mil Familias III, by Rodolfo Gonzalez de la Garza. Page 79.
2 CONT ***A.K.A. Maria de Paez.
2 CONT ***Notes for JUAN DE QUINTANILLA-FERNANDEZ-TIJERINA: Source:Mil Familias III by Rodolfo Gonzalez de la Garza, Page 64.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of ANA-MARIA SAENZ-SALDIVAR and JUAN DE QUINTANILLA-FERNANDEZ-TIJERINA are:
2 CONT *1. 169. i. JUAN-DIEGO11 QUINTANILLA-SAENZ, 
2 CONT **b. 13 Jun 1717, Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *2. 170. ii. MARIA-JOSEFA QUINTANILLA-SAENZ, 
2 CONT **b. 01 Mar 1721, Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *3. iii. ANTONIA-ROSALIA QUINTANILLA-SAENZ, 
2 CONT **b. 29 Oct 1724, Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *4. iv. GERONIMO-DE-JESUS QUINTANILLA-SAENZ, 
2 CONT **b. 03 Oct 1727, Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *5. v. MARIA-RITA QUINTANILLA-SAENZ, 
2 CONT **b. 1731, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; 
2 CONT **m. JUAN-MANUEL DE CARDENAS-AGUILAR, 04 Aug 1749, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; 
2 CONT ***b. Zopotlan. (Zapotlán el Grande in Nueva Galicia)
2 CONT ****Notes for MARIA-RITA QUINTANILLA-SAENZ: Mil Familias III, by Rodolfo Gonzalez de la Garza. Page 65.
2 CONT *6. 171. vi. MATIANA-GERTRUDIS QUINTANILLA-SAENZ, 
2 CONT **b. 23 Nov 1732, Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *7. vii. ANNA-MARIA QUINTANILLA-SAENZ, 
2 CONT **b. 16 Jul 1735, Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *8. viii. IGNACIA APOLINARIA QUINTANILLA-SAENZ, 
2 CONT **b. 29 Aug 1740, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; 
2 CONT **m. TOMAS DE-LA-ROSA-PEREZ-RAMON.
2 CONT ***Notes for IGNACIA APOLINARIA QUINTANILLA-SAENZ: Mil Familias III, by Rodolfo Gonzalez de la Garza,. Page 65.
