1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 9. Miguel Eusebio3 Chapa Benavides (Nicolas2 Chapa Treviño, Juan Bautista Schiapapria1 Chapa) 
2 CONT *was born Abt 1705 in Monterrey . 
2 CONT *He married Ana Maria García Guajardo May 24, 1735 in Monterrey 
2 CONT **daughter of Francisco Garcia and Ma. Guajardo.
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Miguel Chapa Benavides and Ana García Guajardo is: 
2 CONT *1. + 25 i. Miguel4 de Chapa Garcia, born Abt 1725 in Camargo, Tamaulipas.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://longoriaf.tripod.com/Chapa.htm#Generation No. 19911
2 CONT
2 CONT ===================
2 CONT
2 CONT Miguel Eusebio Chapa (0327) 
2 CONT *is the legitimate son of Nicolas Chapa (0206) and Maria Inez Benavides Flores. 
2 CONT *Miguel married Ana Maria Garcia (Ref: Marriage Investigations #24-31) on 24 May 1735.
2 CONT **Ana Maria Garcia is the daughter of Francisco Garcia and Maria Gertrudis Guajardo. 
2 CONT *Miguel Eusebio died before 1747. 
2 CONT *At least two children were born of this union.
2 CONT **In April 1747, Bartolome de Trevino married Ana Maria Garcia - widower of Miguel Chapa (0327). Marriage Investigations, #28-21, p-117.
2 CONT **1764 Aug. 15 Miguel Chapa (0465) who married Rosa Maria Trevino at Camargo.
2 CONT **1803 Feb. 15 Nicolas Joseph Chapa (0466), widower of Maria Gertrudis Romero, died at Camargo.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://genforum.genealogy.com/longoria/messages/524.html
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Marriage Notes for MIGUEL-EUSEBIO CHAPA-BENAVIDES and ANA-MARIA GARCIA-GUAJARDO:
2 CONT
2 CONT Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara by Raul J. Guerra,
2 CONT
2 CONT Jr., Nadine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela, Jr. Page 99.
