2 CONT *1. i. ISABEL-MARIA6 RAMON-GARCIA, 
2 CONT **b. Boca de Leones, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; 
2 CONT **m. JOSEPH-ANTONIO PEREZ-DE-CERRALLOS, November 22, 1728, Boca de Leones, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; 
2 CONT ***b. Montanes de Burgos, Castilla, Spain.
2 CONT ****Marriage Notes for ISABEL-MARIA RAMON-GARCIA and JOSEPH-ANTONIO PEREZ-DE-CERRALLOS: Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara by Raul J. Guerra, Jr., Nadine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela, Jr. Page 80.
