1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 221. DIEGO5 DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY-Y-CEPEDA (JUANA4 DE CEPEDA-DE-LA-FUENTE, JUANA3 DE-LA-FUENTE-MARTINEZ, FRANCISCA2 MARTINEZ-GUAJARDO-NAVARRO-RODRIGUEZ, JUAN-FRANCISCO1 MARTINEZ-GUAJARDO) was born in Saltillo, Coahuila
2 CONC , Mexico, and died Aft. May 09, 1733. He married MARIA DE FARIAS-AGUIRRE, daughter of JOSEPH DE FARIAS and INES DE AGUIRRE. She was born in Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of DIEGO DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY-Y-CEPEDA and MARIA DE FARIAS-AGUIRRE are:
2 CONT
2 CONT i. JUANA6 DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY, b. 1689, Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico; m. CAPTAIN PEDRO-SANTIAGO DE ARISPE-CUELLAR, August 1707, Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico; b. March 01, 1685/86, Sagrario Metropolitano, Saltillo, Coahuila, New Spain (M
2 CONC exico).
2 CONT
2 CONT ii. CRISTOBAL DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY, b. 1709; m. MARIA CURBELO-DE-UMPIERRE, December 16, 1749, San Fernando, San Antonio, Bexar County, Texas; b. 1717, Lancerote, Canary Islands, Spain; d. December 06, 1803, San Antonio, Bexar County,
2 CONC  Texas.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for CRISTOBAL DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY:
2 CONT
2 CONT First Alcalde of villa de San Carlos de la Candela, Coahulia, Mexico. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He and his family are listed on the 1777 census of Villa de San Carlos de la Candela, Coahulia, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT iii. DIEGO DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY, m. MARIA-JOSEFA SEGUIN-XIMENEZ.
2 CONT
2 CONT iv. FRANCISCO DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY, m. MARIA-DEL-CARMEN DE VALDEZ.
2 CONT
2 CONT v. ANA DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY.
2 CONT
2 CONT vi. INES DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY. http://www.somosprimos.com/inclan/guajardo.htm
