2 CONT * 			b.	Maria Ignacia FARIAS BENAVIDES m. 10 Jul 1857, in Laredo, Webb Co., TX, Atanacio VIDAURRI GIL, (son of Rafael VIDAURRI GARCIA and Maria Lorenza GIL SANCHEZ).
2 CONT * 			c.	Andres FARIAS BENAVIDES b. 29 Sep 1845, S.P. De Las Colonias, Coah., Mex, m. 1868, Nemecia HERNANDEZ BENAVIDES, b. 31 Oct 1848, Nadadores, (daughter of Marcos HERNANDEZ MONTALVO and Petra BENAVIDES GARCIA-DAVILA) d. 24 May
2 CONC  1902, Monterrey, N.L., Mex.  Andres died 29 Sep 1934.
