2 CONT 5. BERNARDINO7 FERNANDEZ-DE-VELASCO , PEDRO5, JUAN4, PEDRO3, FERNAN2 SANCHEZ-DE-VELASCO, SANCHO1) died 1512. He married MARIA ENRIQUEZ-DE-SARMIENTO, 
