2 CONT Notes for FRANCISCO FERNANDEZ-DE-VELASCO:
2 CONT
2 CONT The 2nd Count of Haro. In 1472 he was made Constable of Castilla, Spain. Source:From the book, Historia Genealogica de las Familias Mas Antiguas de Mexico, by Don Ricardo Ortega y Perez Gallardo.
