1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Origin of the Surnames Garza and Treviño by Tomas Mendirichaga Cueva. Page 16.
2 CONT
2 CONT ALFEREZ ANDRES5 LOZANO-DE-LA-GARZA (MARIANNA4 DE-LA-GARZA-DE-LA-ROCHA, PEDRO3 DE-LA-GARZA-RODRIGUEZ, PEDRO2 DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON-TREVINO, MARCOS-ALONSO1 DE-LA-GARZA-Y-ARCON) was born 05 May 1682 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, and
2 CONC  died 16 Jun 1741 in Nuevo Leon, Mexico. He married (1) ANTONIA DE GONGORA 07 Jan 1708/09 in Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, daughter of JUAN-FRANCISCO DE GONGORA-Y-AGUILAR and JUANA MARTINEZ-GUAJARDO. She w
2 CONC as born 1685, and died 1724 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. He married (2) MARIA-TERESA CAVAZOS-FERNANDEZ 15 Apr 1725 in Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, daughter of JOSEPH CAVAZOS-DE-LA-GARZA and JACINTA F
2 CONC ERNANDEZ-DE-CASTRO-Y-DE-LA-CERDA. She died 1737. He married (3) MATIANA DE AYALA-DE-LA-GARZA 21 Apr 1738 in Sagrario Metro, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, daughter of NICOLAS DE AYALA-Y-BENAVIDES and ANTONIA DE-LA-GARZA-DE-LA-GARZ
2 CONC A. She was born 1718 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, and died 1739. He married (4) MARIA-JOSEFA DE-LA-GARZA-SOSA 21 Nov 1740 in Valle del Carrizal, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, daughter of JUAN DE-LA-GARZA-MONTEMAYOR and MARIA DE SOSA. S
2 CONC he was born 1690.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for ALFEREZ ANDRES LOZANO-DE-LA-GARZA:
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: Origin of the Surnames Garza and Trevino by Tomas Mendirichaga Cueva. Page 16.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage Notes for ANDRES LOZANO-DE-LA-GARZA and ANTONIA DE GONGORA:
2 CONT
2 CONT Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara by Raul J. Guerra, Jr., Nadine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela, Jr. Page 205 [46-13].
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for MARIA-JOSEFA DE-LA-GARZA-SOSA:
2 CONT
2 CONT Descendent of Don Juan de Oñate, colonizer of New Mexico. She descends from Onate’s mother, Dona Catalina de Salazar de Cadena and her first marriage to Don Ruy Diaz de Mendoza. A daughter from this first marriage, Dona Magdalena 
2 CONC de Mendoza Salazar and her husband, Don Vicente de Saldivar y Onate are ancestors of Dona Josefa de la Garza.
2 CONT
2 CONT Another participant in the colonization of New Mexico (USA), and an ancestor of this group is Captain Bernabé de las Casas, who married Dona Beatriz Navarro, the daughter of Don Juan Navarro, a founder of Saltillo. Beatriz was the
2 CONC  first wife of Captain Alonso de Sosa Albornoz, killed in New Mexico by orders of Oñate. Alonso’s grandfather was the Conquistador Don Andrés de Tapia, perhaps the most trustworthy and reliable of the captains of the Marquis del V
2 CONC alle de Oaxaca, Hernán Cortés.
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: A History of New Mexico by Gaspar Perez de Villagra, Alcala - 1610, translated by Gilberto Espinosa.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of ANDRES LOZANO-DE-LA-GARZA and ANTONIA DE GONGORA are:
2 CONT
2 CONT 231. i. JOSEPH-JOAQUIN6 LOZANO-GONGORA.
2 CONT
2 CONT ii. FRANCISCO-ANDRES LOZANO-GONGORA, b. 13 Jan 1710, Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT 232. iii. JUANA-MARIA LOZANO-GONGORA, b. 1711, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT 233. iv. PEDRO-JOSE LOZANO-GONGORA, b. Abt. 1712, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT 234. v. MARIA-EMERENCIANA LOZANO-GONGORA, b. 1716.
2 CONT
2 CONT 235. vi. ANDRES-SILVESTRE LOZANO-GONGORA, b. 07 Jan 1716, Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT 236. vii. MARIANA-JOSEFA LOZANO-GONGORA, b. 1718, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; d. Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT 237. viii. FRANCISCO-ANTONIO LOZANO-GONGORA, b. 09 Feb 1720, San Jose de los Sauces, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; d. Aft. 20 Jun 1783.
2 CONT
2 CONT 238. ix. JOSE-SANTIAGO-ESTOLANO LOZANO-GONGORA, b. 10 May 1724, Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT x. PHELIPA LOZANO-GONGORA, b. 10 May 1724, Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children are listed above under (64) Maria-Teresa Cavazos-Fernandez.
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of ANDRES LOZANO-DE-LA-GARZA and MATIANA DE AYALA-DE-LA-GARZA is:
2 CONT
2 CONT xi. MARTIANA DOMINGA DOROTEA6 LOZANO-AYALA, b. 21 Jun 1739, Sagrario Metro, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; m. ANTONIO FLORES.
2 CONT
2 CONT
