2 CONT 17. THOMASINA-ISABEL4 GUTIERREZ-DE-LA-GARZA (GERTRUDIS3 DE-LA-GARZA, PEDRO2 FLORES-DE-ABREGO, PEDRO1) She married CAPTAIN RODRIGO MARTINEZ-DE-LA-GARZA October 19, 1693 in Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, son 
2 CONC of JOSEPH-IGNACIO MARTINEZ-FLORES and MARIA-INEZ DE-LA-GARZA-DE-LA-ROCHA. He was born November 05, 1673 in Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for CAPTAIN RODRIGO MARTINEZ-DE-LA-GARZA:
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: The Conquistadores and Crypto-Jews of Monterrey, by Davis T. Raphael.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage Notes for THOMASINA-ISABEL GUTIERREZ-DE-LA-GARZA and RODRIGO MARTINEZ-DE-LA-GARZA:
2 CONT
2 CONT Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara, by Raul J. Guerra, Jr., Nadine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela, Jr. Page 37.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of THOMASINA-ISABEL GUTIERREZ-DE-LA-GARZA and RODRIGO MARTINEZ-DE-LA-GARZA are:
2 CONT
2 CONT i. MICAELA5 MARTINEZ-GUTIERREZ, m. JUAN-ANTONIO GONZALEZ.
2 CONT
2 CONT ii. JOSE-FELIX MARTINEZ-GUTIERREZ, b. August 02, 1696, Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT iii. MARIA-NICOLAS MARTINEZ-GUTIERREZ, b. February 02, 1702, Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT iv. MARIA-GERTRUDIS MARTINEZ-GUTIERREZ, b. September 11, 1705, Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; m. LAZARO DE-LA-GARZA-SALDIVAR, June 27, 1723, Sagrario Metro, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; b. Monterrey, Nuev
2 CONC o Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for LAZARO DE-LA-GARZA-SALDIVAR: He is a descendent of the Onate-Zaldivar family of Zacatecas and New Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage Notes for MARIA-GERTRUDIS MARTINEZ-GUTIERREZ and LAZARO DE-LA-GARZA-SALDIVAR: Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara by Raul J. Guerra, Jr., Nadine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela, Jr. Page 230.
2 CONT
2 CONT v. FRANCISCO-JAVIER MARTINEZ-GUTIERREZ, b. November 20, 1707, Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; m. (1) PHELICIANA FLORES; m. (2) ANDREA-FRANCISCA FLORES-GONZALEZ, December 31, 1734, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexi
2 CONC co; b. Salinas Victoria, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
